      },
      "text": "```\nMECHANISM:\n  Judge the probability of event A given information B by asking:\n  \"How much does B resemble/represent the typical A?\"\n  Substitute \"how similar is this to the prototype?\" for \"what is the probability?\""
    },
    {
      "id": "03-HEURISTICS-BIASES.md#005",
      "path": [
        "03-HEURISTICS-BIASES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:behavioral-economics:03-heuristics-biases, git-history:behavioral-economics:03-heuristics-biases]",
        "canonical_path": "behavioral-economics/03-HEURISTICS-BIASES.md",
        "concepts": "[heuristics, biases]",
        "current_path": "behavioral-economics/03-HEURISTICS-BIASES.md",
        "id": "maxim:behavioral-economics:heuristics-biases",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
